Description: user uppercase S in Scalable to fix scaling
 Icons do not scale properly in some circumstances if index.theme does 
 not set Type=Scalable specifically with a capital S.
 .
 gnome-icon-theme-nuovo (0.5-4.3+scrollbar1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Update control to indicate this version is maintained by Scrollbar Linux,
     not by upstream Debian.
   * Add debian/links with symlinks to make Xfce actually use the icons.
   * Fix icon scaling by using case-sensitive Type=Scalable in index.theme
Author: Timothy Gaskell <tngaskell@gmail.com>
